{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPER DEMON PVP is a free online 1v1 FPS.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your movement, aim, timing and resources to defeat your opponents in intense duels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise lasers and powerful charge shots, damage your opponent to grow their weak point. Hit the weak point to defeat them instantly. Defeat them 3 times to win the match. Use your recharging shield to avoid damage and reflect projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create private lobbies to challenge your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch replays and spectate other players to improve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the tutorials and practice with a CPU opponent while waiting for the next match to start. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1-only allows for a unique server architecture. Each match will use the server with the best ping for both players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally a secret easter egg in HYPER DEMON, PVP is now expanded and available free for everyone. Enjoy responsibly.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2801700?t=1762336440","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801700/a66425fb6507e8fadc2231a1e4707438399caf3a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762336440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801700/e318130c9271fad2d725a7cc844183c9971b9e1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762336440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801700/e318130c9271fad2d725a7cc844183c9971b9e1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762336440","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HYPER DEMON PVP is a free online 1v1 FPS.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your movement, aim, timing and resources to defeat your opponents in intense duels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With precise lasers and powerful charge shots, damage your opponent to grow their weak point. Hit the weak point to defeat them instantly. Defeat them 3 times to win the match. Use your recharging shield to avoid damage and reflect projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete on the global leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create private lobbies to challenge your friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch replays and spectate other players to improve. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study the tutorials and practice with a CPU opponent while waiting for the next match to start. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1v1-only allows for a unique server architecture. Each match will use the server with the best ping for both players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Originally a secret easter egg in HYPER DEMON, PVP is now expanded and available free for everyone. Enjoy responsibly.</p>","developers":["Sorath"],"genres":[{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2801700/82b4614a2276c0f23273003fbd3662cf2aac18a4/header.jpg?t=1762336440","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></